{# =====================================================
   GET A QUOTE — WEBSITE V2
   Same visual system and quick-links panel as contact.njk, but a
   qualifying form instead of a general-inquiry one: service interest
   and timeline are added so a submitted lead can be
   prioritized/routed instead of landing as a blank message.
   contact.njk itself is untouched and still exists for general
   inquiries, support, and press — this is the high-intent "I want a
   quote" path the navbar's primary CTA now points to. (Budget range
   was in an earlier version of this form and was deliberately
   dropped per explicit request — not an oversight if it looks
   missing.)

   Submits to this site's own /api/submit-lead serverless function
   (same one contact.njk uses), which forwards to the SAME CRM
   endpoint/table as contact.njk (zunkireelabs-crm/contact-us)
   rather than a new one — see api/submit-lead.js for why the real
   bearer token lives there and not in this file. A `lead_source`
   field distinguishes a quote request from a general contact-form
   submission in the CRM.
   ===================================================== #}

{% include "partials/navbar-v2.njk" %}

<script>
  document.documentElement.classList.add('js-reveal-hidden');
</script>
<style>
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal]:not(.revealed),
  .js-reveal-hidden [data-reveal-stagger]:not(.revealed) > * {
    opacity: 0;
  }
  /* Country-code dropdown list already scrolls (max-h-64 overflow-y-auto) —
     macOS/most browsers just hide the scrollbar until actively scrolling,
     so it read as cut-off/broken. Force it visible as a thin track instead. */
  .country-scroll {
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: #d1d5db transparent;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 6px;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: transparent;
  }
  .country-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background-color: #d1d5db;
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }
</style>

{# =====================================================
   HERO — same centered shell as contact.njk's hero.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 pb-8 pt-32 sm:px-6 sm:pt-36 lg:px-8 lg:pt-40" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex max-w-[56rem] flex-col items-center text-center" data-reveal-stagger>

    <span class="mb-4 inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500 shadow-subtle">
      Angebot anfragen
    </span>

    <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-center text-balance text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[42px] sm:leading-[1.1] lg:text-[48px]">
      Erzählen Sie uns von Ihrem Projekt
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-4 max-w-[560px] px-4 text-center text-balance text-[18px] font-medium leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] sm:text-[20px]">
      Teilen Sie uns einige Details mit, und ein Mitglied des Zunkiree-Labs-Teams meldet sich mit einer konkreten Einschätzung, in der Regel innerhalb eines Werktags.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   QUOTE FORM SECTION — same glass-surface form card (right) +
   quick-links rail (left) as contact.njk.
   ===================================================== #}
<section class="px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 lg:px-8 lg:pb-24" aria-labelledby="quote-form-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 id="quote-form-heading" class="sr-only">Formular zur Angebotsanfrage und Schnelllinks</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-12" data-reveal-stagger>

      {# Left: "Wie es weitergeht" (2/5 width) — genuinely quote-specific,
         not a copy of contact.njk's quick-links panel. Numbered-step
         treatment reuses the same font-mono step-number recipe already
         used in admizz-case-study.njk's "Key engineering decisions"
         section. Secondary links (general contact, pricing) are kept but
         demoted to a small text row instead of being the panel's content. #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 lg:order-1">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-6 shadow-subtle sm:p-7">
          <span class="mb-6 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">
            Wie es weitergeht
          </span>

          <div class="space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/10 font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">1</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Sie sagen uns, was Sie brauchen</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Leistung und Zeitrahmen – dauert etwa eine Minute.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/10 font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">2</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Wir prüfen Ihr Projekt</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Ein Teammitglied sieht sich die Details an, in der Regel innerhalb eines Werktags.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-7 w-7 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/10 font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#5a9100]">3</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Sie erhalten eine konkrete Einschätzung</p>
                <p class="mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Kostenlos und unverbindlich – keine Verpflichtung, weiterzumachen.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 border-t border-navy-100/60 pt-5 text-[13px]">
            <a href="/de-ch/contact/" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] transition-colors hover:text-[#4d7a00]">Stattdessen allgemeiner Kontakt →</a>
            <a href="/pricing/" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] transition-colors hover:text-[#4d7a00]">Preise ansehen →</a>
          </div>

          {# Social Links #}
          <div class="mt-6 border-t border-navy-100/60 pt-6">
            <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">Folgen Sie uns</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-navy-400">
              <a href="{{ site.social.linkedin }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-navy-900" aria-label="LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20’447 20’452h-3’554v-5’569c0-1’328-.027-3’037-1’852-3’037-1’853 0-2’136 1’445-2’136 2’939v5’667H9’351V9h3’414v1’561h.046c.477-.9 1’637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3’601 0 4’267 2.37 4’267 5’455v6’286zM5’337 7’433c-1’144 0-2’063-.926-2’063-2’065 0-1’138.92-2’063 2’063-2’063 1.14 0 2’064.925 2’064 2’063 0 1’139-.925 2’065-2’064 2’065zm1’782 13’019H3’555V9h3’564v11’452zM22’225 0H1’771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1’729v20’542C0 23’227.792 24 1’771 24h20’451C23.2 24 24 23’227 24 22’271V1’729C24 .774 23.2 0 22’222 0h.003z"/></svg>
              </a>
              <a href="{{ site.social.instagram }}" class="transition-colors hover:text-navy-900" aria-label="Instagram" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zM12 0C8.741 0 8.333.014 7.053.072 2.695.272.273 2.69.073 7.052.014 8.333 0 8.741 0 12c0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98C8.333 23.986 8.741 24 12 24c3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98C15.668.014 15.259 0 12 0zm0 5.838a6.162 6.162 0 100 12.324 6.162 6.162 0 000-12.324zM12 16a4 4 0 110-8 4 4 0 010 8zm6.406-11.845a1.44 1.44 0 100 2.881 1.44 1.44 0 000-2.881z"/></svg>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      {# Right: Quote Form (3/5 width) — native Alpine.js form, same
         payload base as contact.njk's contact-us submission plus the
         new qualifying fields and a lead_source marker. #}
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 lg:order-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-100/70 via-sky-50/30 to-white/40 p-6 shadow-subtle backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8"
            x-data="{
              firstName: '',
              lastName: '',
              workEmail: '',
              countryCodes: {{ countryCodes | dump }},
              phoneCode: '+977',
              phoneCountryName: 'Nepal',
              phoneFlag: '🇳🇵',
              phone: '',
              country: '',
              serviceInterest: '',
              timeline: '',
              description: '',
              optIn: false,
              submitting: false,
              submitted: false,
              error: false,
              async submitQuoteForm() {
                if (!this.firstName.trim() || !this.lastName.trim() || !this.workEmail.trim() || !this.serviceInterest) return;
                this.submitting = true;
                this.error = false;
                try {
                  const res = await fetch('/api/submit-lead?form=quote', {
                    method: 'POST',
                    headers: {
                      'Content-Type': 'application/json'
                    },
                    body: JSON.stringify({
                      first_name: this.firstName.trim(),
                      last_name: this.lastName.trim(),
                      email: this.workEmail.trim(),
                      phone: this.phone.trim() ? (this.phoneCode + ' ' + this.phone.trim()) : null,
                      country: this.country.trim() || null,
                      how_would_you_like_to_connect_with_us: 'Get a Quote',
                      what_can_we_help_you_with: this.description.trim() || null,
                      opt_in_for_marketing_communication: this.optIn,
                      lead_source: 'get-a-quote',
                      service_interest: this.serviceInterest,
                      timeline: this.timeline || null
                    })
                  });
                  if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Submit failed: ' + res.status);
                  this.submitted = true;
                } catch (err) {
                  console.error('[get-a-quote form] submit error', err);
                  this.error = true;
                } finally {
                  this.submitting = false;
                }
              }
            }"
          >
            {# Success state #}
            <div x-show="submitted" x-cloak class="py-10 text-center">
              <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#F0F5E8] text-[#5a9100]">
                <svg class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-[18px] font-medium text-[#111827]">Danke für die Angaben</h3>
              <p class="mt-1.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">Ein Mitglied des Zunkiree-Labs-Teams meldet sich in Kürze mit einer konkreten Einschätzung.</p>
            </div>

            {# Form #}
            <form x-show="!submitted" @submit.prevent="submitQuoteForm()" novalidate>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <label for="first_name" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Vorname <span class="text-[#76B900]">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="first_name" x-model="firstName" required
                    class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="last_name" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Nachname <span class="text-[#76B900]">*</span></label>
                  <input type="text" id="last_name" x-model="lastName" required
                    class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5">
                <label for="work_email" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Geschäftliche E-Mail <span class="text-[#76B900]">*</span></label>
                <input type="email" id="work_email" x-model="workEmail" required
                  class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <div>
                  <label for="phone" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Telefon</label>
                  <div class="flex gap-2">
                    {# Searchable country-code picker — matches the same UX
                       EdgeX's own native form uses for this field
                       (edgex.zunkireelabs.com/form/zunkireelabs-crm/contact-us),
                       not an invented pattern. #}
                    <div class="relative" x-data="{ codeOpen: false, codeSearch: '' }" @click.outside="codeOpen = false">
                      <button type="button" @click="codeOpen = !codeOpen"
                        class="flex w-[92px] flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-between gap-1 rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-2.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                          <span x-text="phoneFlag"></span>
                          <span x-text="phoneCode"></span>
                        </span>
                        <svg class="h-3 w-3 flex-shrink-0 text-navy-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </button>
                      <div x-show="codeOpen" x-cloak x-transition
                        class="absolute z-20 mt-1 w-72 overflow-hidden rounded-md border border-navy-100 bg-white shadow-lg">
                        <div class="border-b border-navy-100 p-2">
                          <input type="text" x-model="codeSearch" placeholder="Land suchen…"
                            class="w-full rounded border border-navy-100/60 px-2 py-1.5 text-[13px] outline-none focus:border-[#76B900]">
                        </div>
                        <div class="country-scroll max-h-64 overflow-y-auto overscroll-contain py-1" data-lenis-prevent>
                          <button type="button" x-show="!codeSearch" @click="codeOpen = false"
                            class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 bg-[#F0F5E8] px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium text-[#111827]">
                            <span x-text="phoneFlag"></span>
                            <span x-text="phoneCountryName + ' (' + phoneCode + ')'"></span>
                          </button>
                          <template x-for="c in countryCodes.filter(c => c.name !== phoneCountryName && (c.name.toLowerCase().includes(codeSearch.toLowerCase()) || c.code.includes(codeSearch)))" :key="c.name">
                            <button type="button" @click="phoneCode = c.code; phoneCountryName = c.name; phoneFlag = c.flag; codeOpen = false; codeSearch = ''"
                              class="flex w-full items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] text-[#111827] transition-colors hover:bg-navy-50">
                              <span x-text="c.flag"></span>
                              <span x-text="c.name + ' (' + c.code + ')'"></span>
                            </button>
                          </template>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <input type="tel" id="phone" x-model="phone" placeholder="98XXXXXXXX"
                      class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label for="country" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Land</label>
                  <input type="text" id="country" x-model="country"
                    class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5">
                <label for="service_interest" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Was brauchen Sie? <span class="text-[#76B900]">*</span></label>
                <select id="service_interest" x-model="serviceInterest" required
                  class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Leistung auswählen</option>
                  {% for svc in [
                    { label: "KI-Entwicklung", value: "ai_development" },
                    { label: "KI-Kundenerlebnis", value: "ai_customer_experience" },
                    { label: "Datensysteme", value: "data_system" },
                    { label: "Individuelle Software", value: "custom_software" },
                    { label: "SaaS-Entwicklung", value: "saas_development" },
                    { label: "Web- und App-Entwicklung", value: "website_app_development" },
                    { label: "AEO & SEO", value: "aeo_seo" },
                    { label: "KI-E-Commerce", value: "ai_ecommerce" },
                    { label: "Agentic as a Service (GaaS)", value: "gaas" },
                    { label: "Noch unsicher", value: "not_sure" }
                  ] %}
                  <option value="{{ svc.value }}">{{ svc.label }}</option>
                  {% endfor %}
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5">
                <label for="timeline" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Zeitrahmen</label>
                <select id="timeline" x-model="timeline"
                  class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Zeitrahmen auswählen</option>
                  {% for t in [
                    { label: "So bald wie möglich", value: "asap" },
                    { label: "1–3 Monate", value: "1_3_months" },
                    { label: "3–6 Monate", value: "3_6_months" },
                    { label: "Mehr als 6 Monate", value: "6_plus_months" },
                    { label: "Noch unsicher", value: "not_sure" }
                  ] %}
                  <option value="{{ t.value }}">{{ t.label }}</option>
                  {% endfor %}
                </select>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-5">
                <label for="description" class="mb-1.5 block font-mono text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-800">Erzählen Sie uns von Ihrem Projekt</label>
                <textarea id="description" x-model="description" rows="4" placeholder="Was möchten Sie entwickeln oder lösen?"
                  class="w-full rounded-md border border-navy-100/60 bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-[14px] text-[#111827] outline-none transition-colors focus:border-[#76B900] focus:ring-1 focus:ring-[#76B900]/30"></textarea>
              </div>

              <label class="mt-5 flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
                <input type="checkbox" id="opt_in_for_marketing_communication" x-model="optIn" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 rounded border-navy-200 text-[#76B900] focus:ring-[#76B900]/30">
                Ich möchte Marketing-Mitteilungen von Zunkiree Labs erhalten.
              </label>

              <p x-show="error" x-cloak class="mt-4 text-[13px] font-medium text-red-600">
                Beim Senden Ihrer Anfrage ist etwas schiefgelaufen. Bitte versuchen Sie es erneut oder schreiben Sie uns direkt per E-Mail.
              </p>

              <button type="submit" :disabled="submitting"
                class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-[#76B900] px-6 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#5a9100] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60 sm:w-auto">
                <span x-show="!submitting">Mein Angebot anfordern</span>
                <span x-show="submitting" class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <svg class="h-4 w-4 animate-spin" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle>
                    <path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5’373 0 0 5’373 0 12h4zm2 5’291A7’962 7’962 0 014 12H0c0 3’042 1’135 5’824 3 7’938l3-2’647z"></path>
                  </svg>
                  Wird gesendet…
                </span>
              </button>
            </form>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# =====================================================
   FAQ — quote-specific questions, grounded in pricing.njk's
   own real content (same figures/policies, not invented).
   ===================================================== #}
{% set quoteFaq = [
  {
    question: "Was kostet ein typisches Projekt?",
